    "section": "13. Terrain",
    "ruleNumber": "13.05",
    "summary": "Dense Terrain is substantial enough to shield models from enemy sight. Examples include ruins, woods and buildings. A **terrain area** containing a dense feature is [Obscuring](vsdata:core-rule/obscuring). See [Hidden](vsdata:core-rule/hidden) and [Solid](vsdata:core-rule/solid) for their rules on dense terrain.",
